WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.620
The thing about the station is that we're used to involving Congolese youth, most of whom want to go live in danger.

2
00:00:05.840 --> 00:00:10.880
On the contrary, most are looking for opportunities, looking for a better life.

3
00:00:11.480 --> 00:00:13.240
And most just want to succeed in their lives.

4
00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:17.560
So they want an environment that guarantees them that better, dream life.

5
00:00:17.980 --> 00:00:22.960
I, generally, have already faced prejudice when I was in high school.

6
00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:26.240
They called me Ikeike, which means "we didn't care" and all that.

7
00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:30.800
People told me I shouldn't become who I am, that I'm really short, like your height.

8
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:34.460
Because I had a tiny head, I was short in stature and all that.

9
00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:38.400
So over time, I'm not the same size I used to be.

10
00:00:39.180 --> 00:00:44.680
And I kept the small head, but maybe today there's a lot of knowledge,

11
00:00:44.840 --> 00:00:49.240
direct skills that I can even pass on, and that let me assert myself in society.
